        },
        {
          "sid": "drinks-t1-s05",
          "c": "我杯奶茶走甜。",
          "j": "ngo5 bui1 naai5 caa4 zau2 tim4.",
          "e": "My milk tea, no sugar.",
          "note": "走 (zau2) in ordering means \"hold / leave out\" — 走甜 (zau2 tim4) \"no sugar\", 走冰 (zau2 bing1) \"no ice\". So 奶茶走甜 (naai5 caa4 zau2 tim4) is \"milk tea, no sugar\" — essential cha chaan teng shorthand.",
          "bd": [
